## What this generates

A voice intake and clinical-scribe app:

- `app/main.py` — a `VoiceLoop` wired to mock ASR/TTS by default (clearly
  marked seam to swap in a real ASR/TTS provider or a telephony adapter).
- `app/scribe.py` — turns a turn transcript into a structured `IntakeNote`
  (a pydantic model) via `agenticcarekit.capabilities.extract.extract`.
- `app/prompts/*.md` — the system and scribe prompts, framed as decision
  support (documentation, navigation, triage routing, education) — never
  diagnosis or treatment instructions.
- `app/tools/` — an example `@tool` with a mandatory mock, so the demo
  runs with zero network calls.
- `app/fixtures/` — synthetic sample intake transcripts, generated the
  same way the healthcare pack's `SyntheticGenerator` does (seeded,
  reproducible, clearly not real patients).

